    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "UUNITEDFIRST\nmen u",
      "FEATURED WINES\nYour flight attendant will inform you of today's selections.\nTO BEGIN\nJumbo lump crabmeat with cornbread and tarragon vinaigrette\nWhite Wine\nChardonnay\nFetzer Sundial Mendocino\nPionero Central Valley Chile\nRed Wine\nCabernet Sauvignon\nGeyser Peak California\nMerlot\nFetzer Eagle Peak Mendocino\nMAIN COURSE\nGrilled filet mignon with chasseur sauce\nAccompanied by a potato casserole with parsnips and leeks\nand sautéed mushrooms with red peppers\nSautéed turkey cutlet with puttanesca sauce\nOffered with sautéed celery with fennel and jalapeño polenta\nCrispy chicken breast with an herbed cream sauce\nComplemented by cheese grits cake and green and yellow squash\nThe above entrees are accompanied by a garden fresh salad\nwith oil and vinegar or Gorgonzola dressing\nPotato crusted salmon\nServed atop seasonal greens with lemon dressing,\naccompanied by a fruit appetizer\nDESSERT\nIce cream sundae\nBEN\u0026JERRY'S. Vanilla and Coffee ice cream\naccompanied by hot fudge sauce, wafer and whipped cream\nSTARBUCKS. coffee will be available throughout the flight.\nCrystal Geyser Natural Alpine Spring Water\nPRIOR TO ARRIVAL\ncookies warm from the oven\nTRANS CON TO1.11\n103D001-1\n3/99"
    ],
